```

[State the typography strategy: pure system stack? One serif accent on which surface? Why?]

### Loading discipline

`font-display: swap` mandatory. System fallback must be visually compatible.

### Scale (5-step modular, ratio 1.25)

| Step          | Size   | Use                              |
|---------------|--------|----------------------------------|
| `--text-xs`   | 12-13px| Eyebrow, citations, footnotes    |
| `--text-sm`   | 13-14px| Source text, secondary metadata  |
| `--text-md`   | 14-16px| Body, table cells (default)      |
| `--text-lg`   | 18-20px| Panel titles, key numbers        |
| `--text-xl`   | 22-26px| Section headings                 |
| `--text-2xl`  | 28-34px| Page titles                      |

- Minimum body size: **13 px**.
- `text-wrap: balance` on H1 and H2.
- `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums lining-nums` on every digit.

