## 7. Guidelines

### Accessibility

- WCAG-AA on every critical screen.
- Allergen / regulatory icons + text + border, never colour-only.
- Touch targets ≥ 48px.
- `:focus-visible` ring on every focusable element.

### Motion

- Duration scale: 100 / 300 / 500 ms only.
- `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` disables all transitions.
- Only `opacity` and `transform` animated. Layout properties forbidden.
- No bounce, no elastic, no celebration animations.

### Performance

- [Page]-view < 1 s on slow Wi-Fi (NFR).
- [Live calc] recalculation < 200 ms (NFR).

### Copy

- Verb + object on every button label ("Save recipe" not "Save").
- Tone: matter-of-fact, [domain]-professional.
- No em dashes. Use commas, periods, or middle-dot.
- One term per concept.

