## 9. Agent prompts

Guidance for AI agents producing new components in this system.

### Hard rules

1. Always start from semantic tokens, never raw hex.
2. If a number, wrap in `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums lining-nums`.
3. If allergen / regulated, badge MUST be icon + text + border.
4. If destructive action, default to ghost button not red.
5. Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
6. Verify WCAG-AA on every text pair introduced.
7. Cards reserved for distinct data domains.
8. Touch targets ≥ 48px.

